WEBVTT

00:00:59.931 --> 00:01:03.726
This court is likely
to overrule Roe and Casey

00:01:03.768 --> 00:01:06.854
or so undermine its meaning

00:01:06.854 --> 00:01:10.608
that it will be effectively
unavailable for use.

00:01:11.109 --> 00:01:13.653
Now I heard your gasps,

00:01:13.694 --> 00:01:14.946
I'm going to say it again.

00:01:14.987 --> 00:01:18.241
The Federal Constitution
of the United States

00:01:18.282 --> 00:01:22.286
will no longer protect
reproductive freedom.

00:01:22.912 --> 00:01:26.666
Now I'm also here to tell you

00:01:26.707 --> 00:01:28.543
that there's hope.

00:01:29.127 --> 00:01:32.839
That we can preserve, by working together,